<title>PORTUGAL: SOCCER-LAZIO BEAT BENFICA IN PRE-SEASON FRIENDLY.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-LAZIO BEAT BENFICA IN PRE-SEASON FRIENDLY.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-08-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result of a pre-season soccer friendly played on Tuesday:</p>
<p>Benfica (Portugal) 0 Lazio (Italy) 1 (halftime 0-1)</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Lazio - Roberto Mancini 43</p>
<p>Attendance: 45,000.</p>
</text>
